    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think this is exactly, you know, really frankly, where I believe we need to go. And it's one of the reasons why a few weeks ago, I started releasing from the investigations under the last Congress the transcripts of these interviews of Bruce Orr of Lisa Face, Peter Shruck, George Papadopoulos, and now Nelly Orr. To show exactly where this was heading and how it started, It's one thing to just say that we need to investigate the roasting the Mueller program in it, but unfortunately, most of them want to start and stop there. The problem was how did you get there to begin with? What's the president? You played a clip of the president talking about the spy nation. What's concerning many of us is that concerning that the intelligence community, the law enforcement community combined on what really became not a focus on a campaign, but a focus on a person. And that's why we're trying to see exactly why this process broke down, how it broke down, and to maybe give Bill Barr the possibility to make sure it doesn't happen again.",
